  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.6.1:\n      - Promotes selected v1.6.x candidate follow-ups: value transformers and before/after map hooks.\n      - Adds AFC014, AFC015, and AFC016 diagnostics so transformers and hooks are visible in mapping plans.\n      - Preserves explicit defaults: transformers and hooks apply only to opt-in convention mappings.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
